Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:07.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:18.94,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.61,0:00:23.80,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:27.57,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:34.92,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:41.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.69,0:00:49.66,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:56.07,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:59.37,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:03.91,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.22,0:01:10.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:21.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.38,0:01:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像和父亲一起住的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.59,0:01:56.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.36,0:01:58.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:10.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第55话 石之花与七宝的初恋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:14.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 该不会是假情报吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.77,0:02:18.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种村落会有四魂碎片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:23.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇也感受不到 四魂碎片的气息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.55,0:02:24.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 完全没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:28.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之还是散开来寻找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:30.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解散
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.63,0:02:37.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.96,0:02:41.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会 想一个人去勾引女人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:42.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.97,0:02:46.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有妖怪的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:49.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 你这种态度对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.51,0:02:56.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:58.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明才刚开始找耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:03:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有妖怪的话一闻就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:04.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就是想偷懒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.53,0:03:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天气真好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:14.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪？七宝不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:18.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概跑去玩了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:21.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还是小孩子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:27.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉 真是让人担心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.55,0:03:31.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这阵子一直不断战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:35.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔也该让他们两人独处一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:42.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:43.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不会被你们逮到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.73,0:03:44.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,揍扁她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:49.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:52.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你偷了我们家的柿子干对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:54.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有偷 你有看到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.37,0:03:56.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 你这骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙 等哥哥回来后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会好好的修理你们一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:01.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:05.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥不是早就死在战场上了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:08.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我父亲在他死前照顾他的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥才没有死呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:11.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.82,0:04:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋 小偷还敢打人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.77,0:04:25.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:28.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.27,0:04:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼…赢了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:47.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:48.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 狸猫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是狐狸啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.23,0:04:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是帮助我的谢礼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:53.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要吃一半
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偷来的柿子干
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.87,0:04:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:02.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来真的是这家伙不对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:05.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫五月 你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我 我叫做七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝？好帅气的名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.19,0:05:16.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲帮我取的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.05,0:05:19.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 你父亲是妖怪狸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.39,0:05:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐狸啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是故意的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.83,0:05:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 你有亲人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.83,0:05:32.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出生后不久就去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.57,0:05:34.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:36.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我还有一个哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等他在战场立下大功
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:39.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为武士后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:41.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会回来迎接我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:45.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那刚才那些小鬼在撒谎咯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:47.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:49.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:51.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.49,0:05:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也会活着回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:57.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别让你看看 我的宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:05:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要对它许愿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:01.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何愿望都会实现
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:05.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:07.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它叫做四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说是妖怪的宝贝碎片喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:12.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:22.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.89,0:06:25.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么愿望 都能实现的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:29.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会成为武士的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.47,0:06:38.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥绝对不会说谎的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:48.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗？法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.98,0:06:51.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我家有妖怪盘踞着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:55.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 若没有尽早驱除的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是法师的义务
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:06:59.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您不需要答谢我 名主大人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:03.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么说 各位的 餐点与床铺已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:06.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒那家伙又在唬人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:11.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:15.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地震
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:35.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的有妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.59,0:07:37.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:39.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是胡扯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:40.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:43.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:46.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:50.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝你居然知道这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:53.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找这附近看起来最富裕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:56.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又在做法事的人家准没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:07:59.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总…总之
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.55,0:08:01.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到四魂碎片了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:06.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女孩…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:09.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是五月吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:18.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让姐姐看看你的碎片好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:19.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会想抢走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:22.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然要抢 如果是真的的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:24.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:29.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的 只是看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.75,0:08:33.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 如果是真的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:34.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就非拿走不可
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来五月的愿望就会…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:42.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会判断的这么草率
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:44.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 笨蛋 我是大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:46.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:51.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以了吧 我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:53.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 路上小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:56.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让她回去好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.24,0:09:01.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 你还是不想来我们家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:05.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥现正在回来的路上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:08.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 那个碎片…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.15,0:09:12.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 那是石之花
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石之花？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:15.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是石英吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:18.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之是山上就能挖到的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.90,0:09:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不是四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是冒牌货啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:27.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.27,0:09:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月是个可怜的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥已经确定是战死的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:35.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她却不愿意相信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望哥哥能快点回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.99,0:09:45.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使我说由我们照顾她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:46.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她依然不肯离开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.39,0:09:48.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经和哥哥一起生活的小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然被轰出了名主的家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那小女孩可以利用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:09:59.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我记住！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:19.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂拥有能创造 奈落分身的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:22.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果向真正的碎片许愿的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:26.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月的哥哥就能活着回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.86,0:10:59.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,图形好可怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:01.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:08.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:12.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉！你不是在睡觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:13.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放过我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:15.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是帮助人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:17.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:22.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你也知道四魂之玉的可怕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:25.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是人类能使用的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:29.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 你为什么要偏袒那小女孩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:31.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷恋人家了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:34.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的脸长得蛮可爱的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:37.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙 为了这么烂的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:38.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我迷恋她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:45.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在桔梗跟戈薇之间 摇摆不定的你也没资格说我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:48.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去睡觉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:54.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:11.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:19.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:24.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你久等了 你过得好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.65,0:12:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直相信！我一直相信着！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:33.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥一定会回来的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.16,0:12:42.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少应该向她道别
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:46.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月会不会一直 对着假碎片祈祷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:49.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我实在说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情的真相…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.18,0:12:55.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:57.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的愿望实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.58,0:12:59.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.69,0:13:08.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 七宝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.69,0:13:11.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那叫做五月的女孩那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:14.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他真的很担心她呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:19.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月的哥哥早就不在人世了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:22.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她却深信假的碎片而等待着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.91,0:13:26.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:27.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又要多管闲事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:31.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.09,0:13:36.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 虽然哥哥受了一点伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.02,0:13:39.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥真的回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:44.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是托你和四魂碎片的福
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:14:00.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥要快点治好伤口 恢复精神喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.91,0:14:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…让你吃了这么多苦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:07.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后哥哥会让你很幸福的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你过来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀…你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:19.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在名主家借宿的 那一行人的伙伴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:21.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:23.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能把那东西拿来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.57,0:14:28.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.21,0:14:30.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开五月
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:33.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要做什么 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:35.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:37.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不就有一个吗 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.28,0:14:40.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不明白啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种烂石头一点用都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.22,0:14:49.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然将实现五月愿望的碎片…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:55.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去拿四魂碎片来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就扭断五月的脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.30,0:15:01.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.51,0:15:06.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是你哥哥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.31,0:15:07.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现出原形吧 妖怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:10.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐火！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:15.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这小鬼真狠
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:19.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来觉得当她哥哥也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:21.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:24.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋 我饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:46.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:54.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经被发现了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:56.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休想逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:57.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.79,0:16:00.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 你先逃走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.43,0:16:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 我怎么能这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:06.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只能一个人骑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:08.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:13.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逮到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:26.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是五月住的小木屋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.53,0:16:32.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细看 是大肚子妖怪的杰作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:35.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少他们似乎是逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.87,0:16:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.17,0:16:38.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之先追上七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:42.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两人一定要平安啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.25,0:16:49.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是七宝的狐妖术
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.55,0:16:50.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是五月
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:17:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝在妖怪那里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:05.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 走吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 你一定要平安逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:22.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小女孩逃走是没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.15,0:17:25.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:27.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,矮子 我要拿你当人质
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去抢四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你一开始就应该找我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.29,0:17:35.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然还刻意践踏五月的心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:38.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋 我饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.23,0:17:41.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思 你想和我打吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.77,0:17:43.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:45.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 消化液
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分身
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:53.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 爆雷筒…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:55.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.55,0:18:04.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 你闹够了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:11.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的力量还是不够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:20.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能跟大家一样战斗吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:26.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:36.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么 还没得到教训
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又变成奇怪的家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 你在找碴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:50.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚好…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.34,0:18:53.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿你试试刚领悟的爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.14,0:18:57.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 你在胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将对手的妖气卷入风之伤中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:06.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再让妖气逆流的必杀剑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流…啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:18.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！对手的妖气太弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.63,0:19:20.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流破根本就用不出来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:22.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在罗哩叭唆什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:24.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:26.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太弱了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:28.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.91,0:19:39.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是昨晚从名主家中 赶走的妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:44.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.66,0:19:49.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你这次相当努力嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.90,0:19:52.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.43,0:19:53.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:19:59.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你解决了那只妖怪对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我 是犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:04.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.15,0:20:08.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪就已经被扁得很惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:10.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:13.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只妖怪知道打不过我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.85,0:20:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以想利用五月吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:18.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一牵扯到四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:20.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都会遭遇不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.43,0:20:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪我忘的一干二净
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.46,0:20:25.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才让五月碰到这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.14,0:20:38.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:43.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.75,0:20:45.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.69,0:20:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要让名主大人照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:49.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我已经知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:51.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥已经不在人世了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:01.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保重喔 五月
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:06.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能遇见你真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 你一定要幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.01,0:21:18.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你一样没有父母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.39,0:21:23.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 我不是一个人活着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:40.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你是不是喜欢那孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.47,0:21:41.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:44.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是人小鬼大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:48.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然小也是男人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.21,0:21:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,初恋呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.55,0:21:53.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:57.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 再拖拖拉拉就不理你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:21:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.31,0:22:30.52,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.62,0:22:42.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:50.10,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.38,0:22:53.11,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:57.37,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.92,0:23:05.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.63,0:23:12.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.67,0:23:20.13,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.87,0:23:27.47,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.88,0:23:35.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.30,0:23:48.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个村子里的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.84,0:23:52.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都被妖怪公主魅惑 而一去不回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.91,0:23:54.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然弥勒法师 单枪匹马前去驱逐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.21,0:23:57.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是提到弥勒法师的弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.21,0:23:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是美丽的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.08,0:24:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下子就有点危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.08,0:24:02.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然担心他的珊瑚
